        "TileImage": "$($repository 0ed260f3-7029-4471-9dde-d27ae50cbde5).Image",
        "Description": "The current record on Hokkaido&apos;s Main Mission, Situs Inversus, is held by lukedotpng, who completed a spin in 2 minutes and 5 seconds. This spin has been recreated on the Patient Zero mission here, since Erich Soders is not a viable contracts target. In the match, the condition was &quot;Shoot the Heart&quot; as Surgeon, and Cleaver as Morgue Doctor for Yuki Yamazaki. If you shoot the heart destined for Erich Soders in this mission, the Target Kokoro will die in his stead.",
